flowchart TD
  step1["In a disposable scanner fixture select a standard harmless scanner-test artifact owned by QA and send it."]
  step2["Inspect the visible scan error and attempt direct media download/publication."]
  step3["Use a separately configured unavailable scanner fixture and attempt finalization of a harmless file."]
  step4["Restore scanner availability and inspect the rejected reservation and UI retry outcome; begin a fresh permitted selection when needed."]
  record["Compare every expected result; record PASS, FAIL or BLOCKED for this run"]
  step1 --> step2
  step2 --> step3
  step3 --> step4
  step4 --> record
